# CODEOWNERS — bkrupa/legacy-sports
#
# "Require review from Code Owners" is ENABLED in branch protection (T17, LS-3998).
# require_code_owner_review:true is set in .github/ruleset.json.
#
# Default catch-all (*) is intentionally omitted until T3 (LS-3860) provisions the
# reviewer service account and its GitHub username is confirmed.  Add it as:
#   *    @<service-account-username>
# once T3 is complete.
#
# Order matters: last matching pattern wins, so general rules come first,
# path-specific rules come last.
#
# All handles confirmed via LS-3859 (T2) — sole developer, no GitHub org teams.

